OL,3,GNEWSAJailed nursery worker's prison
OL,4,Aterm increased
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former nursery worker who was jailed
OL,7,Ffor making indecent images of children
OL,8,Fand falsifying job references has had
OL,9,Fhis sentence increased.
OL,11,FKristian Parry, 27, was arrested at the
OL,12,Fnursery where he worked in Leeds in May
OL,13,Flast year after police suspected he had
OL,14,Fuploaded indecent images of children.
OL,16,FIt emerged he had more than 5,000
OL,17,Fpictures and videos on his laptop and
OL,18,Fphone. None of the images involved
OL,19,Fchildren in his care.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
